<title>ESTONIA: HOIU MAY REVISE PROFIT FORECAST IN AUG.</title>
<headline>HOIU MAY REVISE PROFIT FORECAST IN AUG.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Hoiupank might revise its profit forecast in August, after the bank has audited its half-year results, Olari Taal, the chairman of the bank's board, said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We may be forced to put more money than planned into the invasion in Lithuania,&quot; Taal added at a news conference.</p>
<p>Hoiupank's first quarter profit was 40.2 million kroons and its profit estimate for the whole year is 113 million kroons.</p>
<p>The bank has plans to epxand its operations in Lithuania this summer.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
